OL,3,GNEWSASchools 'paying double' to cover
OL,4,Aswimming lessons
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaigner seeking to reopen a
OL,7,Fswimming pool has warned that a
OL,8,Fshortage of facilities is putting extra
OL,9,Ffinancial pressure on schools to pay
OL,10,Ffor pupils to learn to swim.
OL,12,FJeremy Thackray, who is behind a
OL,13,Fcampaign to reopen Bingley Pool, said
OL,14,Fsome schools in Bradford had reported
OL,15,Ftheir costs had "effectively doubled"
OL,16,Fbecause they now had to transport
OL,17,Fpupils to other pools or bring in
OL,18,Ftemporary facilities.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
