OL,3,GNEWSASchools 'paying double' to cover
OL,4,Aswimming lessons
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis comments come as councillors
OL,7,Fprepare to examine provision across the
OL,8,Fdistrict, with a cross-party scrutiny
OL,9,Freview looking at how schools are
OL,10,Fensuring children learn to swim.
OL,12,FThackray said there was "a real
OL,13,Fshortage of pool space" and the
OL,14,Fauthorities must "act fast" to plug the
OL,15,Fgap.
